; bal -X EUR --unrealized must foot to zero when a posting carries its own
; date.  The Brokerage posting of the 2024/01/01 purchase is dated
; 2024/01/15, after the dollar fell from EUR 0.90 to EUR 0.80.  Both
; postings of the purchase are converted at the rate of the transaction's
; date, so the purchase adds nothing to the report total, and the whole
; change in the euro value of the lot is the one unrealized row, equal to
; minus the --gain total.  The report used to total EUR10.00.
;
; Under --pivot, --pivot-only, --account, --payee and --date,
; transfer_details copies each posting into a transaction of its own, dated
; by the posting, so the two postings of the purchase no longer share a
; date.  A baseline that valued each cost on the date of its transaction
; converted the $1500 at EUR 0.80 on one side and at EUR 0.90 on the other,
; and printed Equity:Unrealized Gains EUR-310.00 and a total of EUR-150.00.
; These reports keep the revaluation between postings and print what they
; printed before, a total of EUR10.00.

P 2024/01/01 $ 0.90 EUR
P 2024/01/10 $ 0.80 EUR

2024/01/01 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL @ $150  ; [2024/01/15]
    Assets:Checking

P 2024/03/05 AAPL $170

test bal -X EUR --unrealized
           EUR160.00  Assets
          EUR1360.00    Brokerage
         EUR-1200.00    Checking
          EUR-160.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
                   0
end test

test bal -G -X EUR
           EUR160.00  Assets:Brokerage
end test

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --pivot payee
          EUR-150.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
           EUR160.00  payee:Buy:Assets
          EUR1360.00    Brokerage
         EUR-1200.00    Checking
--------------------
            EUR10.00
end test

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --pivot-only payee
          EUR-150.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
           EUR160.00  payee:Buy
--------------------
            EUR10.00
end test

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --account account
           EUR160.00  Assets
          EUR1360.00    Brokerage
          EUR1360.00      Assets:Brokerage
         EUR-1200.00    Checking
         EUR-1200.00      Assets:Checking
          EUR-150.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
            EUR10.00
end test

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --payee payee
           EUR160.00  Assets
          EUR1360.00    Brokerage
         EUR-1200.00    Checking
          EUR-150.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
            EUR10.00
end test

test bal -X EUR --unrealized --date date
           EUR160.00  Assets
          EUR1360.00    Brokerage
         EUR-1200.00    Checking
          EUR-150.00  Equity:Unrealized Gains
--------------------
            EUR10.00
end test
